{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n人氣護膚品牌 Glow Recipe 破天荒同韓國三養辣雞麵合作，推出限量版潤唇膏套裝「Glass Balm Lip Duo」！靈感正正來自辣雞麵最經典嘅原味同粉紅奶油Carbonara口味，將平時辣到標眼水嘅即食麵，搖身一變成為美妝潮物！今次套裝一共有兩款色號：黑色原味款「Original」主打溫暖磚紅色調，仲特別帶有微辛甜香嘅清涼微刺感，搽上去即刻有豐唇嘟嘟效果。\n</p>\n<p>粉紅款「Carbonara」就係好溫柔嘅櫻花粉色，質地好滑好滋潤，為雙唇深層補水兼打造超靚玻璃水光感！<br/>\n套裝入面仲送埋個超得意嘅專屬聯乘匙扣，又得意又實用，各位美妝控同辣雞麵 fans 點可以唔入手試吓！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322208623717_10963045846ae21c167c396.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322208623717_10963045846ae21c167c396.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322482388875_8263312026ae21c1927890.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322482388875_8263312026ae21c1927890.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322666033484_7830198246ae21c1b11899.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322666033484_7830198246ae21c1b11899.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322830588813_20353787636ae21c1c9230d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322830588813_20353787636ae21c1c9230d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322970071825_21355613246ae21c1e14e99.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179320322970071825_21355613246ae21c1e14e99.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfCmPovkcwB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T16:20:49.653173+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T16:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:58:38.123904+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:24.810770+00:00","content_hash":"393497445cf8ebd5b3e88e5ed96601247d5aac46680f938538586703e53c96d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}